Attribution
-----------

SplashControl does not bundle the Splash runtime. It requires a separately
installed Splash server and talks to it over its local HTTP API.

Splash — the high-performance local LLM inference engine this app
supervises — is developed by IncoAI (https://github.com/incoai) and is
available at https://github.com/incoai/splash under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.
